  "prefLabel": "He-P 4019.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4019.02 Scope. The rules in this part shall apply to all persons who receive, possess, use, own, or transfer sources of radiation registered with or licensed by DHHS/RHS.\n\nSource. #5903, eff 2-1-95; ss by #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8692, INTERIM, eff 7-27-06, EXPIRES: 2-2-07; ss by #8808, eff 1-24-07; ss by #10805, eff 3-28-15; ss by #14301, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
